    "Removed invented periodic transmit beep and support-acknowledgement triad from UAV gameplay. Legacy resource/event IDs remain for compatibility. Destruction break cue retained.",
    "Silent QA now mutes only the actual OpenAL listener output. Logical master and hostile volume remain 1, so native SoundManager channel activation is genuinely tested."
